          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na eekaa ũla Yeova wonaa wĩ ũthũku: ndaatia naĩ syonthe sya Yelovoamu mwana wa Nevati, ila wavĩtĩthisye Isilaeli nasyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.24"
            ]
